  "Text.Store\u2420named\u2420Regex,\u2420SystemVariable,\u2420Configuration,\u2420Prompt,\u2420KnowledgeReference,\u2420BusinessObjectReference,\u2420DXFunctionReference,\u2420or\u2420CodeDomTarget\u2420records.\u2420Sensitive\u2420values\u2420stay\u2420out\u2420of\u2420AI\u2420briefings\u2420and\u2420logs.",
